<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-LEADING GERMAN LEAGUE CHAMPIONSHIP SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING GERMAN LEAGUE CHAMPIONSHIP SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-02-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the German league</p>
<p>championship after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>14 - Sean Dundee (Karlsruhe)</p>
<p>11 - Ulf Kirsten (Bayer Leverkusen), Paulo Sergio (Bayer</p>
<p>Leverkusen), Bernhard Winkler (1860 Munich), Fredi Bobic (VfB</p>
<p>Stuttgart)</p>
<p>10 - Andreas Herzog (Werder Bremen), Jonathan Akpoborie (Hansa</p>
<p>Rostock), Martin Max (Schalke), Giovane Elber (VfB Stuttgart)</p>
<p>9 - Toni Polster (Cologne)</p>
</text>
